The **BOHOL compact snack and drink vending machine** uses the ZD-C-10 catalogue platform: a narrow spiral-channel cabinet with a 10.1-inch touchscreen, adjustable 6 × 6 channel reference layout and project-specific payment integration. The catalogue lists reference dimensions of H1955 × W800 × D850 mm including casters, a 180 kg reference weight and capacity of approximately 180-720 items depending on product size. Product compatibility, payment modules, power, artwork, controller, connectivity and acceptance tests must be confirmed in the approved order specification.

Send representative products, the destination market, site measurements, payment-provider requirements, branding files and estimated quantity for a configuration review.
